  data: {
    LLM: '1. The player with the highest double leads (or highest tile if no doubles).\n2. Players must match the pips of an open end of the linear layout.\n3. **Blocking**: If you cannot match an end, you pass your turn.\n4. The layout is restricted to two ends; doubles are placed crosswise but do not create new lines.',
    Player: '1. The player with the highest double leads (or highest tile if no doubles).\n2. Players must match the pips of an open end of the linear layout.\n3. **Blocking**: If you cannot match an end, you pass your turn.\n4. The layout is restricted to two ends; doubles are placed crosswise but do not create new lines.',
    objective: 'Win the round by playing all tiles in your hand, or by having the lowest total pips when the game is blocked.',
